  "summary_text": "Solution walkthrough with Horizonte Foods' Supply Chain Director, led by Lucas Moreira with Ana Ribeiro joining as backup.",
  "summary_markdown": "Solution walkthrough with Horizonte Foods' Supply Chain Director, led by Lucas Moreira with Ana Ribeiro joining as backup.",
  "private_notes_text": null,
  "private_notes_markdown": null,
  "transcript": [
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Lucas Moreira"
      },
      "text": "Hi Paula. Ana is joining us today because I'm on holiday next week and she'll cover for me.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-03T18:00:08Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-03T18:00:15Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Paula Reis"
      },
      "text": "Hi Lucas, hi Ana. Welcome.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-03T18:00:16Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-03T18:00:18Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "Hi Paula, nice to meet you.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-03T18:00:20Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-03T18:00:22Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Lucas Moreira"
      },
      "text": "Today we'll walk through how your forty distributors would log orders and visits in the CRM.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-03T18:00:25Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-03T18:00:31Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Paula Reis"
      },
      "text": "The main thing for us is one view per distributor: orders, visits, and the promotions they're running.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-03T18:02:10Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-03T18:02:17Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Paula Reis"
      },
      "text": "This looks good. I'd like my regional managers to see it before we go further.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-03T18:09:45Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-03T18:09:51Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Lucas Moreira"
      },
      "text": "Of course. I'll set up a session with your regional managers when I'm back.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-03T18:10:02Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-03T18:10:07Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Paula Reis"
      },
      "text": "Thanks, both. Enjoy your holiday, Lucas.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-03T18:26:30Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-03T18:26:32Z"
    }
  ]
}
